The R190Q and R190W don’t kink $\alpha$ -helical domain, but their side chains can disturb CC assembly. The carriers have later age of disease onset and no skeletal muscle involvement. Asymptomatic carriage of these mutations suggests additional factors of disease manifestation. The mutation effects might be modified by the general genetic background.
